<http://data.silknow.org/object/cf07dc94-dbc0-3eb5-accd-54efe50c89ca>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Bonnet of straw braid, trimmed externally with shaded green and white moiré ribbon. With black machine-made lace at the border of the bavolet and internally with a blond edged white tulle frill and at the brow with black and white blond interspaced with rose buds. There is a black silk covered stiffened band to hold the bonnet in place and white silk ribbon ties."@en , "Straw bonnet with ribbon and machine-made lace, made in England, ca. 1860"@en ;
